   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  25 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 18 35 Proofread by  ADELE ARDOLINO GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast biopsy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with a black stitch designating the biopsy site  The specimen is inked black and serially sectioned to reveal 85  focally cystic and gritty dense gray white fibrous tissue and a 15  tan yellow adipose tissue  No discrete mass is grossly appreciated  and a representative section of the designated biopsy site is submitted for frozen section as FX 1  now as G  Representative sections of the fibrous tissue are submitted sequentially as A J with the region surrounding the previous biopsy site as F H  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast stitch at 12 0 clock   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 7cm right modified radical mastectomy specimen with an attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm axillary tail  The specimen is partially surfaced by a irregular REMOVED_DATE x 15 0cm gray tan portion of skin with no apparent scar  The margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm focally indurated gray white to pink mass with irregular borders which comes to 3 0cm of the deep margin and 0 4cm of the inferior superficial margin  The surrounding dense gray white fibrous tissue is focally cystic and gritty  and occupies the approximately 40  of the remaining memory tissue with the remainder comprised of tan yellow adipose tissue  Sectioning of the axillary tail reveals numerous firm gray pink lymph nodes  ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1 6cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted as follows  K   tumor to deep margin  L   tumor to inferior medial superficial margin  M N  additional tumor  O   fibrous tissue away from tumor  representing outer quadrants  P   fibrous tissue away from tumor  representing inner quadrants  Q   one half of three lymph nodes  R T  lymph nodes  submitted in toto  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  PAUL MICHAELS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY  Sclerotic breast tissue with minor fibrocystic changes  O R  Resident  NICOLE ANN BELSLEY  MD O R  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY , 3.
