ical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  22 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 17 19 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast lesion  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of fibroadipose tissue which is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm tan white stellate firm nodule abutting the inked margin  A representative section of the tumor and margin is frozen as frozen section  1  and resubmitted in cassette H  The lesion is submitted entirely in cassettes A   C  Representative sections of the remainder of the tissue is submitted in cassettes D   G  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  ERIN OCHOA  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  RIGHT BREAST LESION  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Suzanne B  Keel  M D  O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , 0.
