cent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  30 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 15 30 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a portion of fibrofatty breast tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm with an overlying ellipse of skin measuring REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a firm white irregularly defined area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm that abuts the deep and lateral margins  The closest lateral margin in A  deep margin in B  C  J are representative sections of the firm area  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right axillary contents  is a portion of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm  There are six rubbery nodules  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  The nodules are entirely submitted in cassettes K and L  Resident  ERIN OCHOA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY PART B  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODE   report_end  , 0.
